<section class="round-shell guided-test-shell">
<header class="guided-test-header"><small>ARKFLIGHT · LIVE CREW TEST</small><h2>Three rounds. Ten crew. Real rolls.</h2><p>Two level-5 ships · five assigned level-5 NPC stations each</p></header>
<div class="guided-test-build">{{build}}</div><div class="guided-test-progress"><b>{{status}}</b>{{#if guide}}<span>Round {{s.round}} / 3 · Step {{guide.step}}</span>{{/if}}</div>
<main class="round-workspace">
{{#if paused}}<p class="round-alert">Foundry is paused. Unpause before clicking Next Step.</p>{{/if}}
{{#if error}}<p class="round-error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p>Download the debug file before restarting. Movement recovery retains resolved dice.</p>{{/if}}
{{#if recovery}}<section class="round-alert"><b>Saved movement needs recovery</b><button data-guided-action="resume-movement">Resume saved movement</button><button data-guided-action="restore-movement">Restore initial positions</button></section>{{/if}}
{{#if running}}<section class="guided-next-step"><small>NEXT ACTION · ONE CLICK, ONE COMMAND</small><h3>{{step.label}}</h3><button class="round-primary" data-guided-action="next" {{#unless canNext}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if busy}}Resolving…{{else}}Next Step{{/if}}</button></section>{{else}}{{#if complete}}<section class="guided-next-step"><h3>Three-round test complete</h3><p>Your debug.txt download has been requested. Use Download again if the browser blocked it.</p></section>{{else}}<p>Create the dedicated fixtures, then watch each action using Next Step. Crew checks, attacks, damage, cards and token movement run through the real controller.</p>{{/if}}{{/if}}
{{#if guide}}<p class="round-note">{{guide.exerciseBattery}}</p><p class="guided-last-action"><b>Last action:</b> {{guide.lastLabel}}</p>{{/if}}
{{#if last}}<article class="guided-roll-result"><b>{{last.outcome}} · {{last.skill}}</b><span>d20 {{last.die}} + {{last.modifier}} = {{last.total}} vs {{last.dc}}</span></article>{{/if}}
<details class="guided-crews"><summary>Ship and crew manifest</summary>{{#each crews}}<h3>{{name}} · Ship level {{level}}</h3>{{#each crew}}<p><b>{{station}}</b> · {{name}} · level {{level}}</p>{{/each}}{{/each}}</details>
<details><summary>What goes into debug.txt?</summary><p>Build/system/module versions, every command, real roll results, AP/resources, crew skills, expected versus actual token hexes/facing, movement recovery, and browser warnings/errors from this test onward.</p><p>Capture survives a page refresh in local browser storage. F12 can stay closed. This cannot retrieve old console messages or the Foundry server log.</p></details>
</main>
<footer class="guided-test-footer"><button class="round-primary" data-guided-action="start" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>{{#if guide}}Restart test{{else}}Create ships &amp; start test{{/if}}</button><button data-guided-action="hand">Show hand</button><button data-guided-action="download">Download debug.txt</button>{{#if running}}<button data-guided-action="stop" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>Stop &amp; export</button>{{/if}}</footer>
</section>
